:0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- **Expand** should be renamed to \"Ignore\" (for consistency with the stretch aspect project setting), \"Distort\" or perhaps just \"Stretch\" as it leads to aspect ratio distortion. This should be made clear from the get go as it's generally a bad option for anything that displays a logo.\r\n  - Maybe \"Ignore (Distort)\"?\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_109596.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21861672/test_pr_109596.zip)\r\n\r\nExample with the default setting at various aspect ratios (splash image is 7680×2160, i.e. designed for 4K displays with aspect ratio up to 32:9):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_194749\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e20963f-7510-4d5a-a9e4-da2535ef4445\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_194800\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd6509eb-6cf7-4aae-a73a-ed531f93f8c3\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_194813\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32d5dae5-5079-43fa-be09-9e45d20d2dae\" />\r\n\r\n## Stretch mode comparison\r\n\r\n*Window aspect ratio is 48:9.*\r\n\r\n### Disabled\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_195035\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4335a9e1-9baa-489b-ad32-d31c73219bf6\" />\r\n\r\n### Keep / Keep Height\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_195031\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf9e4eac-7f6e-4301-8d68-179107ca7152\" />\r\n\r\n### Keep Width / Cover\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_195007\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/263933bf-0cb7-4fe0-bf91-353bb8e9f47a\" />\r\n\r\n### Expand\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250819_195017\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43bd94a6-049d-4c58-8b8c-253ea9103d40\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109596#pullrequestreview-3133297215","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109596","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-19T17:58:15Z"},{"id":3147701964,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc67nh7M","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109596#pullrequestreview-3147701964","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109596","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-23T10:57:00Z"},{"id":3147703096,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc67niM4","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109596#pull